SUMMARY: Beginner Square Dance Party – No Partner Needed!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n## 🎉 Square Dan
 ce Party Night – Beginners Welcome!\n\n**Never square danced before? Thi
 s party is for you!**\nJoin **Capital Squares** for a fun\, relaxed square
  dance party designed especially for **first-timers and curious beginners*
 *.\n\n**Note: Space is limited to 40 new dancers!** Grab your tickets on [
 Eventbrite](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1989599513704?aff=oddtdtcreator)[
  ](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1984382456345?aff=oddtdtcreator)before the
 y sell out. Meet-up will only allow 10 RSVPs. There is no need to RSVP on 
 Meet-up in order to attend! **This event is cross-posted and open to the p
 ublic.**\n\n📅 Tuesday\, June 16\, 2026\n📍 St. James United Methodist
  Church\, 3808 St. James Church Rd\, Raleigh\, NC\n⏰ 7:00 to 9:00 pm. Do
 ors open at 6:30.\n\n**Cost: $10.00 per person** via [eventbrite](https://
 www.eventbrite.com/e/1989599513704?aff=oddtdtcreator). Zelle\, cash or che
 ck at the door.\n\n### What This Is\n\nA lively\, social square dance part
 y where **everyone is welcome** — even if you’ve never danced before.\
 n\nWe’ll start with **easy\, walk-through instruction**\, then dance the
  night away with friendly guidance and lots of laughter.\n\n### What You N
 eed to Know\n\n* **No experience required**\n* **No partner needed**\n* Ca
 sual attire — wear comfortable clothes and shoes\n* Friendly atmosphere 
 — we rotate partners and dance together\n* Great music\, great people\, 
 and lots of fun\n\n### Who Should Come\n\n* Adults who have never square d
 anced\n* Couples\, singles\, and friends\n* Children 10 or older accompani
 ed by a participating adult.\n* Anyone looking for a fun\, social night ou
 t in Raleigh\n* People curious about trying something new in 2026\n\n### W
 hy Try Square Dancing?\n\nSquare dancing is easy to start\, mentally engag
 ing\, and one of the **best ways to meet people** while having fun. You’
 ll be dancing successfully your very first night.\n\n👉 Purchase your ti
 cket on Eventbrite ([https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1989599513704](https://w
 ww.eventbrite.com/e/1989599513704?aff=oddtdtcreator)) and join us for a ni
 ght of fun\, laughter\, and community with **Capital Squares**!\n\nCheck u
 s out on [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/capitalsquares/) and [Instagr
 am](https://www.instagram.com/capital_squares_raleigh/) or visit [https://
 CapitalSquares.org/learn](https://CapitalSquares.org/learn)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 4800746/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260515T125339Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260515T125339Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
