SUMMARY:June Pool Party!!!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nJune Pool Party!!!
 \nFriday June 19th\, 6pm\nLet’s start splashing in our favorite North Ra
 leigh pool!\nBring a dish to share!\nIf someone wants to bring some music 
 🎼\, that's cool too. 💃\nFeel free to bring a friend or two! Limited 
 parking so you may want to carpool.\nNo glass!!!\nNorth Raleigh location w
 ill be shared upon RSVP\nOrganizer: Dwen Andrews dwencita@gmail.com 919 62
 4 0762 / 919 244 2710 LE2609
